---
title: "applicationReview (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_pending: application submitted and deposit confirmed
    q_pending --> q_review: begin review process
    q_review --> q_approved: full approval
    q_review --> q_partial: partial approval
    q_review --> q_rejected: rejection
    q_approved --> q_refund_window: enter 14-day MiCA refund period
    q_refund_window --> q_vesting: refund period expires
    q_vesting --> [*]: tokens claimable after vesting
    q_partial --> q_claim_excess: claim excess USDC refund via contract
    q_claim_excess --> q_refund_window_p: enter 14-day MiCA refund period
    q_refund_window_p --> q_vesting_p: refund period expires
    q_vesting_p --> [*]: claim tokens after vesting
    q_rejected --> q_claim_full: claim full USDC refund via contract
    q_claim_full --> [*]: full refund claimed

    note right of q_review
        INV-001: review must produce exactly one of: full approval, partial approval, rejection
        INV-002: partial approval accepts only a percentage of deposited amount
    end note

    note right of q_refund_window
        INV-003: MiCA mandates 14-day refund period for EU citizens
        INV-004: refund period applies to both full and partial approvals
    end note

    note right of q_rejected
        INV-005: rejected applications must allow immediate full USDC refund
        INV-006: refund is executed on-chain via smart contract
    end note
